    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "9d72fecc_4b31c5be",
        "filename": "kernel/sched/core.c",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 1022,
      "author": {
        "id": 1456182
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-02-05T12:16:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Did you mean to highlight the if condition below?\n\nSo the logic is meant to honor the highest hold value requested.\n\n |  Task A enqueue hold_ms request graph\n |\n |     _______________    \u003c- uclamp_min \u003d 800\n |    |               |\n |    |               |\n |    |               |\n |    |               |\n |    |               |\n |_________________________________________\n\n |  Task B enqueue hold_ms request graph\n |\n |          _______________    \u003c- uclamp_min \u003d 400\n |         |               |\n |         |               |\n |         |               |\n |_________________________________________\n\n |  RQ hold_ms final graph (what\u0027s implemented in this patch)\n |\n |     ____________________    \u003c- uclamp_min \u003d 800\n |    |                    |\n |    |                    |\n |    |                    |\n |    |                    |\n |    |                    |\n |_________________________________________\n\n |  RQ hold_ms final graph (what you propose?)\n |\n |     _______________    \u003c- uclamp_min \u003d 800\n |    |               |\n |    |               |____    \u003c- uclamp_min \u003d 400\n |    |                    |\n |    |                    |\n |    |                    |\n |_________________________________________\n\nSo IIUC, what you say if Task A requested a hold_ms with a uclamp_min \u003d 800, but then shortly after another task was enqueued with a uclamp_min \u003d400, we should update uclamp_hold_value to 400 which ends up with that last graph? If yes, then Task A request was dishonered, no?",
      "parentUuid": "c5fbbe0f_c023524c",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1022,
        "startChar": 9,
        "endLine": 1022,
        "endChar": 13
      },
      "revId": "abb2d80ea13b521ac0b22cc41811c18c500cbe5d",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "bf3b01fd_673122e7",
        "filename": "kernel/sched/core.c",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 1022,
