        "id": 1122323
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-02-05T12:32:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, as Qais says this is intentional behaviour to minimise updates.\n\nThe basic rules are:\nFor a clamp hold which comes into effect whilst another is active:\n1. The time can be extended, but never reduced\n2. The clamp value can be raised but never lowered",
      "parentUuid": "9d72fecc_4b31c5be",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1022,
        "startChar": 9,
        "endLine": 1022,
        "endChar": 13
